{
  "analysis": "We have OCR from sparse 5-second samples and TSV bounding boxes showing the prompt line is around y=658. The second TSV command may still be running or queued. I need verify prompt is back, then create a denser frame extraction/crop pipeline to capture all command lines. The sparse samples are insufficient for 262 moves.",
  "plan": "First wait/verify shell prompt is ready. Then extract frames at 2 fps, cropped to the terminal/prompt region, and OCR them to capture command lines more completely. I will start by generating dense full-terminal crops and OCR command-like lines.",
